  "title": "Easy Tamale Casserole",
  "description": "This tamale casserole is a one-skillet dish made on the stovetop and oven with layers of tomato and ground beef topped with cornbread and cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Gwendelyn Robinson Grizzle"
  ],
